{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Paint the Snow \u2013 Idle</strong></i> is an engaging idle game set in a colorful, cartoonish winter world. Manage resources, automate processes, and balance mining with battles to keep your world growing\u2014even when you\u2019re away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mining and Meeples</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the meeples \u2014 adorable little buckets that gather resources and pave the way for automation. Every meeple tries their best to keep things running smoothly and efficiently.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.poster.avif?t=1753722123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.webm?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/5a1593b484f0ebcc68779ab973a47607.mp4?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat and Spirits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use spirits \u2014 your allies in battles against waves of monsters. Each spirit is a unique tool for defeating enemies, with multiple stages of evolution. Upgrade them, unlock new forms and abilities to become even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.poster.avif?t=1753722123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.webm?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/56d7062d23a26f8cea43949297ef47b1.mp4?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade Tree</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each part of the game can be expanded and upgraded, so take advantage of it! Unlock new systems with numerous unique upgrades and strategic possibilities. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.poster.avif?t=1753722123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.webm?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/470d90cd6f88dc1a67e67eaef2dde257.mp4?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Feeling lucky?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Speed up your progress with the slot machine, where generous bonuses await!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.poster.avif?t=1753722123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.webm?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/extras/99fcc1798c1c41f713f0bde88996d769.mp4?t=1753722123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854660?t=1753722123","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854660/31cdcea38cf42aa42910f73d6e06eaf8f03dd735/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753722123","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam